#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS.rst:2
msgid "CMAKE_AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS.rst:6
msgid ""
"Switch for forwarding origin target dependencies to the corresponding :ref:"
"`<ORIGIN>_autogen <<ORIGIN>_autogen>` targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS.rst:11
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`<ORIGIN>_autogen_timestamp_deps "
"<<ORIGIN>_autogen_timestamp_deps>` target is created, additional target "
"dependencies are added to it instead of the :ref:`<ORIGIN>_autogen "
"<<ORIGIN>_autogen>` target.  When using the :ref:`Visual Studio Generators`, "
"the ``moc`` and ``uic`` step may be part of the ``<ORIGIN>`` target itself, "
"in which case the dependencies are added to ``<ORIGIN>``.  See the :manual:"
"`cmake-qt(7)` manual for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS.rst:19
msgid ""
"This variable is used to initialize the :prop_tgt:`AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS` "
"property on all the targets.  See that target property for additional "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS.rst:23
msgid "By default ``CMAKE_AUTOGEN_ORIGIN_DEPENDS`` is ``ON``."
msgstr ""
